## Integrations

{% if issue_tracker == "linear" -%}
Issues live in **Linear**. Non-trivial work starts as an issue; plan/SDD flows pull it,
execute, and update status. Without the Linear MCP connected, the skills degrade
gracefully — code proceeds, status stays manual.
{%- elif issue_tracker == "github" -%}
Issues live in **GitHub Issues**. Non-trivial work starts as an issue; plan/SDD flows
reference it and close it from the PR. Without access, the skills degrade gracefully.
{%- else -%}
No issue tracker is wired. Plan/SDD flows run local-only: branch → commit → PR, no
status sync.
{%- endif %}

See `docs/integrations.md` for details and graceful-degradation rules.
